* Perform a CMS370 CREXX build of the linker
&ERROR &EXIT &RETCODE

&DEBUG = &1
&SRCDISK = &2
&BINDISK = &3
&PARMFN = CREXX&DEBUG

EXEC CRXGCC RXLKMAIN C &SRCDISK ( CMS PARM &PARMFN CSECT

GLOBAL TXTLIB CMSUTIL PLATFORM GCCLIB
LOAD RXLKMAI@ CMSUTIL@ PLATFOR@ ( CLEAR NOAUTO RESET @@MAIN
GENMOD RXLINK&DEBUG ( FROM RXLKMAI@
&TYPE RXLINK&DEBUG -H
RXLINK&DEBUG -H
COPY RXLINK&DEBUG MODULE A = = &BINDISK ( OLDDATE REPLACE
COPY LOAD MAP A RXLINK&DEBUG = &BINDISK ( OLDDATE REPLACE
ERASE RXLINK&DEBUG MODULE A
ERASE LOAD MAP A
ERASE * TEXT A

&EXIT 0
